# Ticket: Password Reset

**Scenario:**  
User reports they cannot log into their account and believe they may have forgotten their password.

**First Response to User:**  
Hi [Name],  
I can help you get logged back in. I’ll reset your password 
and provide a temporary one. Once you sign in, you’ll be 
prompted to create a new password.

**Internal Notes:**  
- Verified user identity  
- Located user in M365 Admin Center  
- Performed password reset  
- Temporary password generated  
- Required password change on next sign-in

**Resolution:**  
User successfully logged in using the temporary password and created a new one.

**Root Cause:**  
User forgot their password.

**Preventive Notes:**  
Recommend enabling Self-Service Password Reset (SSPR) to reduce future lockouts.
